      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WYNDRA ALL PRADA (1) has a strong record this trip with four wins and two placings from nine starts. Below best last time at Townsville (22.11) in a Grade 3/4, finishing a 5 length sixth. Looks a leading chance on best. ABRAXOS (3) was below best at his last start when 6th at Townsville following a second place finish (29.96) at this track two back. Has a good record here at this journey. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. ANOTHER MEGHAN (7) is a handy dog who jumped from box 7 last time out and scored by 3.5 lengths at this track (23.61). The form out of her last race has been franked. In great form and can continue her winning ways. BRETT KEEPING (2) missed the frame latest (24.06) when sixth over 407m at this track in a Free For All. Yet to taste defeat in two runs from this draw.",
